  "summary_en": "Hungary's national AI strategy to 2030 with an action plan to 2025. It sets pillars (data economy, R&D, adoption, education, infrastructure, regulation and ethics), sector focuses and transformative programmes. Autonomous vehicles are a flagship, with the ZalaZone test track and planned regulation. It is innovation-led, with an ethics code and a regulatory knowledge centre planned.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Targets by 2030: 15% AI-induced GDP growth and 26% productivity growth.",
   "Autonomous Vehicles National Laboratory and an AV transformative programme, aligned with EU rules.",
   "Plans an AI Ethics Code, an AI regulatory framework (registries, liability, 'technological person') and a Regulation and Ethics Knowledge Centre (MISZET).",
   "Data economy measures: data market, National Data Asset Agency, data wallet under GDPR.",
   "Defence AI and autonomous systems development across air, land, space and cyber domains."
